{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:10:09.968Z","ordinal":9170,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d","item":{"type":"Reasoning","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa605fd95e887d2aa320f40f60cc7ac","summary_text":["**Evaluating app features**\n\nI recognize I'm only two minutes ahead, even though I've put in a lot of effort. I need effective ways to work for nearly two hours. Auditing the app systematically using CUA seems like a solid approach. I can look at original and multiple recordings, comparison references, evaluation tabs, and data sources. We should also inspect a few variant cases with distinct robot motions, perhaps visually comparing them. It’s essential to verify using alt text or screenshots for accuracy in \"Recorded articulation.\""],"raw_content":[]},"started_at_ms":1789265405664,"completed_at_ms":1789265409968}}
{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:10:09.970Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa605fd95e887d2aa320f40f60cc7ac","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[{"text":"**Evaluating app features**\n\nI recognize I'm only two minutes ahead, even though I've put in a lot of effort. I need effective ways to work for nearly two hours. Auditing the app systematically using CUA seems like a solid approach. I can look at original and multiple recordings, comparison references, evaluation tabs, and data sources. We should also inspect a few variant cases with distinct robot motions, perhaps visually comparing them. It’s essential to verify using alt text or screenshots for accuracy in \"Recorded articulation.\"","type":"summary_text"}],"type":"reasoning"}}
