gnal rules.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t192 heading HOW TO READ THE RESULT, Value: 4\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t193 text HOW TO READ THE RESULT\n\t\t\t\t\t\t194 content list\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t195 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t196 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t197 text Best event-semantics and strongest-joint scores in this comparison.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t198 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t199 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t200 text Its 21 ms median onset error is strong, while a 188.6 ms P90 reveals occasional late or early threshold crossings.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t201 text Interpretation limit The joint targets use related signal formulas, so joint accuracy is not independent physical localization evidence.\n\t\t\t\t202 button (collapsed) Evaluation contract and provenance, Secondary Actions: Expand\n\t\t\t\t\t203 text Evaluation contract and provenance\n\nThe focused UI element is 10 checkbox Evaluation, Value: 1"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d","create_time":1789265576.552294}},"metadata":{"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":30000}}
