3 text Best median onset\n\t\t\t\t\t34 text 18 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t35 text 1D CNN\n\t\t\t\t\t36 container Best onset P90\n\t\t\t\t\t\t37 text Best onset P90\n\t\t\t\t\t38 text 140 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t39 text OpenTSLM · answered contacts\n\t\t\t\t\t40 container OpenTSLM usable summaries\n\t\t\t\t\t\t41 text OpenTSLM usable summaries\n\t\t\t\t\t42 text 77.93%\n\t\t\t\t\t43 text 399  of  512\n\t\t\t\t44 container Comparable headline results\n\t\t\t\t\t45 heading Comparable headline results, Value: 2, ID: results-title\n\t\t\t\t\t\t46 text Comparable headline results\n\t\t\t\t\t47 text Every row uses 512 held-out windows and seed 20260912. See provenance below for the CNN boundary.\n\t\t\t\t\t48 table\n\t\t\t\t\t\t49 row\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t50 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t51 text Method\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t52 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t53 text Semantics F1 ↑\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t54 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t55 text Contact F1 ↑\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t56 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t57 text Onset median ↓\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t58 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t59 text Onset P90 ↓\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t60 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t61 text Strongest joint ↑\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t62 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t63 text Usable summary ↑\n\t\t\t\t\t\t64 row\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t65 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t66 text Signal features\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t67 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t68 text 0.9880\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t69 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t70 text 0.9908\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t71 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t72 text 21  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t73 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t74 text 188.6  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t75 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t76 text 0.8413\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t77 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t78 text 0.9707\n\t\t\t\t\t\t79 row\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t80 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t81 text 1D CNN\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t82 text recorded run\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t83 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t84 text 0.9751\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t85 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t86 text 0.9777\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t87 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t88 text 18  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t89 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t90 text 274.0  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t91 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t92 text 0.7565\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t93 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t94 text —\n\t\t\t\t\t\t95 row\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t96 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t97 text OpenTSLM\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t98 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t99 text 0.8845\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t100 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t101 text 0.9871\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t102 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t103 text 54  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t104 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t105 text 140.0  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t106 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t107 text 0.7528\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t108 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t109 text 0.7793\n\t\t\t\t\t\t110 row\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t111 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t112 text Qwen3-VL zero-shot\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t113 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t114 text 0.6951\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t115 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t116 text 0.0291\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t117 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t118 text 42  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t119 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t120 text 313.8  ms\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t121 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t122 text 0.4244\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t123 cell\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t124 text 0.0078\n\t\t\t\t\t125 text Usable summary requires the complete typed contract; parseable JSON alone is insufficient. The CNN value is unavailable without its row-level predictions. Read positive-contact F1 with coverage because abstentions can leave F1 high while making the full answer unusable.\n\t\t\t\t126 container Event semantics and joint attribution\n\t\t\t\t\t127 heading Event semantics and joint attribution, Value: 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t128 text Event semantics and joint attribution\n\t\t\t\t\t129 text Score · higher is better\n\t\t\t\t\t130 text Semantics macro-F1 Strongest-joint accuracy\n\t\t\t\t\t131 text 98.8%\n\t\t\t\t\t132 text 84.1%\n\t\t\t\t\t133 text Signal features\n\t\t\t\t\t134 text 97.5%\n\t\t\t\t\t135 text 75.6%\n\t\t\t\t\t136 text 1D CNN\n\t\t\t\t\t137 text 88.5%\n\t\t\t\t\t138 text 75.3%\n\t\t\t\t\t139 text OpenTSLM\n\t\t\t\t\t140 text 69.5%\n\t\t\t\t\t141 text 42.4%\n\t\t\t\t\t142 text Zero-shot\n\t\t\t\t143 container Onset absolute-error distribution\n\t\t\t\t\t144 heading Onset absolute-error distribution, Value: 2\n\t\t\t\t\t\t145 text Onset absolute-error distribution\n\t\t\t\t\t146 text Milliseconds · lower is better\n\t\t\t\t\t147 text Median error P90 error\n\t\t\t\t\t148 text 21 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t149 text 188.6 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t150 text Signal features\n\t\t\t\t\t151 text 18 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t152 text 274 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t153 text 1D CNN\n\t\t\t\t\t154 text 54 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t155 text 140 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t156 text OpenTSLM\n\t\t\t\t\t157 text 42 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t158 text 313.8 ms\n\t\t\t\t\t159 text Zero-shot\n\t\t\t\t160 container Explore each implementation\n\t\t\t\t\t161 heading Explore each implementation, Value: 2, ID: methods-title\n\t\t\t\t\t\t162 text Explore each implementation\n\t\t\t\t\t163 text What goes in, what is learned, and why the metric profile differs.\n\t\t\t\t\t164 tab group Evaluation methods\n\t\t\t\t\t\t165 tab (selected, settable, boolean) Signal features, Value: 1\n\t\t\t\t\t\t166 tab (selectable, settable, boolean) 1D CNN, Value: 0\n\t\t\t\t\t\t167 tab (selectable, settable, boolean) OpenTSLM, Value: 0\n\t\t\t\t\t\t168 tab (selectable, settable, boolean) Qwen3-VL zero-shot, Value: 0\n\t\t\t\t\t169 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t170 heading Signal features, Value: 3\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t171 text Signal features\n\t\t\t\t\t\t172 text Strongest overall baseline\n\t\t\t\t\t\t173 text audited baseline\n\t\t\t\t\t\t174 heading INPUT, Value: 4\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t175 text INPUT\n\t\t\t\t\t\t176 text Seven normalized torque channels, 1,024 samples each.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t177 heading WHAT IS LEARNED, Value: 4\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t178 text WHAT IS LEARNED\n\t\t\t\t\t\t179 text Class-balanced logistic-regression weights and train-only calibrated thresholds over 35 handcrafted signal features.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t180 heading IMPLEMENTATION PIPELINE, Value: 4\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t181 text IMPLEMENTATION PIPELINE\n\t\t\t\t\t\t182 content list\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t183 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t184 AXListMarker 1. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t185 text Summarize amplitude, impulse, derivative energy, and variability for each joint.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t186 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t187 AXListMarker 2. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t188 text Fit event semantics on training sessions and estimate onset from the first sustained threshold crossing.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t189 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t190 AXListMarker 3. \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t191 text Derive strongest and affected joints with train-only calibrated signal rules.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t192 heading HOW TO READ THE RESULT, Value: 4\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t193 text HOW TO READ THE RESULT\n\t\t\t\t\t\t194 content list\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t195 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t196 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t197 text Best event-semantics and strongest-joint scores in this comparison.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t198 container\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t199 AXListMarker • \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t200 text Its 21 ms median onset error is strong, while a 188.6 ms P90 reveals occasional late or early threshold crossings.\n\t\t\t\t\t\t201 text Interpretation limit The joint targets use related signal formulas, so joint accuracy is not independent physical localization evidence.\n\t\t\t\t202 button (collapsed) Evaluation contract and provenance, Secondary Actions: Expand\n\t\t\t\t\t203 text Evaluation contract and provenance\n\nThe focused UI element is 10 checkbox Evaluation, Value: 1","type":"input_text"}],"type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606aad84087d2b1d5fc9bdd597b73","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"arguments":"{\"code\":\"await traceTab.click(167); await traceTab.getAXState();\",\"title\":\"Verify the OpenTSLM evaluation explanation\"}","call_id":"call_p2AlXVmSH6jWdqpceQpGAKm8","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606aafd6487d2b76131ede40bad66","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265576.90992,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"js","namespace":"mcp__cua_repl","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_p2AlXVmSH6jWdqpceQpGAKm8","id":"fco_01a0988a-0ec4-7671-80e9-33d0cfbffa7e","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265579.71691,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Wall time: 0.3451 seconds\nOutput:","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Browser tab: 3, Title: \"Trace — Robot observability\", URL: \"http://127.0.0.1:5174/\".\nThe following is a diff from the previous accessibility tree with ~ and + representing changed and added elements, respectively. Removed elements are summarized by ID range.\nRemoved element IDs: 183-191, 195-200\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t165 tab (selectable, settable, boolean) Signal features, Value: 0\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t167 tab (selected, settable, boolean) OpenTSLM, Value: 1\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t170 heading OpenTSLM, Value: 3\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t\t171 text OpenTSLM\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t172 text Deployed temporal language model\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t173 text deployed model\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t176 text Seven numeric torque series plus the trained telemetry prompt contract.\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t179 text The time-series encoder, projector, and rank-16 LoRA state on the Llama 3.2 1B backbone.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t204 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t205 AXListMarker 1. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t206 text Patch and encode the raw numeric series, then project them into the language-model token space.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t207 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t208 AXListMarker 2. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t209 text Generate an evidence sentence and structured incident fields from the same temporal input.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t210 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t211 AXListMarker 3. \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t212 text Keep malformed or missing outputs as failures instead of silently repairing them.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t213 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t214 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t215 text Semantics macro-F1 is 0.8845 and the best recorded onset P90 is 140 ms.\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t216 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t217 AXListMarker • \n+\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t218 text A complete usable summary is returned for 77.93%: 399 of 512 windows meet the full typed contract.\n~\t\t\t\t\t\t201 text Interpretation limit Most missing answers are free-motion cases. Generated explanations remain predictions, even when the structured fields are correct.\nThe focused UI element is 167 tab (selected, settable, boolean) OpenTSLM, Value: 1","type":"input_text"}],"type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606ae185c87d2b9b8e731dca293fa","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"arguments":"{\"code\":\"await traceTab.click(202); await traceTab.getAXState();\",\"title\":\"Verify evaluation provenance\"}","call_id":"call_PRJorKcvTyVdL3pS7ICUnaPa","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606ae3f0887d281d7ce019d42d6d7","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265580.278544,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"js","namespace":"mcp__cua_repl","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_PRJorKcvTyVdL3pS7ICUnaPa","id":"fco_01a0988a-1bc4-70e0-ab85-e5894ac046fb","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265583.044039,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Wall time: 0.4237 seconds\nOutput:","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Browser tab: 3, Title: \"Trace — Robot observability\", URL: \"http://127.0.0.1:5174/\".\nThe following is a diff from the previous accessibility tree with ~ and + representing changed and added elements, respectively. Removed elements are summarized by ID range.\nRemoved element IDs: 202-203\n+\t\t\t\t219 container\n+\t\t\t\t\t220 button (expanded) Evaluation contract and provenance, Secondary Actions: Collapse\n+\t\t\t\t\t\t221 text Evaluation contract and provenance\n+\t\t\t\t\t222 text Signal features, OpenTSLM, and Qwen are recomputed from checksum-verified archived predictions joined to the same 512 record IDs across 67 held-out recording groups. The CNN summary reports the same locked test size and seed, but its row-level predictions are not in that audited bundle, so it is visibly marked as a recorded run. Recording sessions were split before window generation. Normalization and thresholds use training sessions only. Joint and evidence targets are deterministic signal-derived labels rather than physical contact-location truth. Audited pipeline · records  6ade06d04c8e … · checkpoint  8ff63b84ae5b … · CNN source  c1ca449  · checkpoint  67e883b997c4 …\nThe focused UI element is 220 button (expanded) Evaluation contract and provenance, Secondary Actions: Collapse","type":"input_text"}],"type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606b1213087d2976ecab09f1e09ad","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"arguments":"{\"code\":\"await traceTab.getScreenshot()\",\"title\":\"Inspect evaluation provenance visually\"}","call_id":"call_nWwhQns2SXba4eSH4J0mROnt","id":"fc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606b17c6887d29cdddc34aa159937","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265583.565595,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"js","namespace":"mcp__cua_repl","type":"function_call"},{"call_id":"call_nWwhQns2SXba4eSH4J0mROnt","id":"fco_01a0988a-2952-7a73-b8bd-5927c4f4d6c6","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265586.51451,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Wall time: 0.0396 seconds\nOutput:","type":"input_text"},{"detail":"original","image_url":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","type":"input_image"}],"type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606b6c56487d28cc947d62351af9a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"The official brief matches the frozen story exactly: Problem + Data, TimeNet Connect, Train + Evaluate, Demonstrate, then the required code/config, checkpoint handoff, dataset docs, and baseline. I also verified a fresh intentional-contact result and a second real 1,024-sample window from another recording; marker navigation starts 400 ms before the event, and unavailable raw windows fail closed without reusing an old answer. I’m backing up the isolated branch now while continuing to monitor.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606bbb52c87d2802baaf7a7742a4a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_LeXaauZbFTRlVEuvjLsb52Jc","id":"ctc_0f3535a43349ee3d016aa606bcb79c87d2b9df590f9eab616d","input":"const r = await tools.exec_command({\n  cmd:\"git push -u origin codex/final-submission-hardening\",\n  workdir:\"/Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet\",\n  yield_time_ms:30000,\n  max_output_tokens:5000,\n  sandbox_permissions:\"require_escalated\",\n  justification:\"May I push the verified isolated hardening branch to the team repository without merging it into main?\",\n  prefix_rule:[\"git\",\"push\",\"-u\",\"origin\"]\n});\ntext(r);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265587.602828,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_LeXaauZbFTRlVEuvjLsb52Jc","id":"ctco_01a0988a-a1fb-7b60-922a-dbbf2b73c9d5","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1789265617.403794,"turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 19.8 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"3c38ae\",\"wall_time_seconds\":17.101281666,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":131,\"output\":\"[entire] Pushing 26 checkpoint ref(s) to origin................. done\\nremote: \\nremote: Create a pull request for 'codex/final-submission-hardening' on GitHub by visiting:        \\nremote:      https://github.com/ukafkasyali/ysamet/pull