{"timestamp":"2026-09-13T02:20:42.082Z","ordinal":9772,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a09736-d5c6-7cc3-a099-0521c0b02bd2","turn_id":"01a0982b-48a6-7a00-b4fb-0f363c602d5d","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-6a0da696-6fd1-42d9-8484-cab47c075382","process_id":"71483","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n \"validator-valid|one repair|repair|evidence-backed|Bosch\" data_ingestion/docs data_ingestion/README.md docs | sed -n '1,240p'"],"cwd":"file:///Users/sametdegirmenci/Downloads/ysamet","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"search","cmd":"rg -n 'validator-valid|one repair|repair|evidence-backed|Bosch' data_ingestion/docs data_ingestion/README.md docs","query":"validator-valid|one repair|repair|evidence-backed|Bosch","path":"docs"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","stdout":"docs/submission/UI_WALKTHROUGH.md:72:310→344 px) as input-repair controls appeared. After separating selection and replay,\ndocs/submission/PILOT_RUNBOOK.md:61:> impact location, root cause, safety status or a repair action. You have five\ndocs/submission/PILOT_RUNBOOK.md:96:| `unsupported_claim_count` | Count each distinct claim of cause, impact location, safety decision, repair outcome or numeric fact unsupported by the report's cited evidence |\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIND_ONBOARDING.md:1:# Bosch CNC blind semantic onboarding: DatasetSpec v0.2\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIND_ONBOARDING.md:5:The definitive frozen v0.2 run produced a validator-valid `DatasetSpec` after one repair round.\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIND_ONBOARDING.md:8:Bosch-specific semantic changes: **NONE**.\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIND_ONBOARDING.md:10:No Bosch-specific production rule, prompt hint, semantic mapping, documentation query, or validator\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIND_ONBOARDING.md:11:exception was added. The Semantic Agent used the full existing Bosch profile and the repository\ndata_ingestion/docs/BOSCH_CNC_V02_BLIN